flowchart LR
  PA[Phase A] --> PB[Phase B] --> PC[Phase C]
  H[Hypothesis] -->|TestedBy| E[Experiment]
  E -->|ProducedBy| F[Finding]
  F -->|Supports / Contradicts| H
  F -->|Informed| D[Decision]
  D -->|Causes| N[Follow-on experiment or phase change]
  C[Constraint / literature] --> E
  S[Session and context] -.-> E
  R[Review / audit / repair] -.-> F
